    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7463" root="حذم" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُذَمٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُذَمَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Short in stature and in step;</i>
(K;) applied to a man: (TA:) and the latter is
likewise fem.; (S, K, TA;) applied to a woman
as meaning <i>short in stature.</i> (S, TA.)

